{"method_name": "getGrandTotal", "logic": "The method aggregates all monetary components of an order to produce the final amount payable. It retrieves the subtotal of all line items, adds the total shipping cost across all ship groups, adds the total sales tax (also stored per ship group), adds any order\u2011level adjustments that are not tied to a specific ship group (e.g., discounts, fees), and finally adds any global adjustments that apply to the whole order (e.g., coupon discounts, promotional credits). No loops are present in the method itself; the loops that compute each component live in the respective getter methods.", "mathematical_formula": "sub_total + total_shipping + total_sales_tax + order_other_adjustment_total + order_global_adjustments", "formula_terms": [{"name": "sub_total", "source_method": "getSubTotal", "required": true}, {"name": "total_shipping", "source_method": "getTotalShipping", "required": true}, {"name": "total_sales_tax", "source_method": "getTotalSalesTax", "required": true}, {"name": "order_other_adjustment_total", "source_method": "getOrderOtherAdjustmentTotal", "required": true}, {"name": "order_global_adjustments", "source_method": "getOrderGlobalAdjustments", "required": true}], "schema_keys": ["cartLines", "shipGroups", "orderAdjustments", "globalAdjustments"], "test_payload": {"cartLines": [{"price": 10.0, "quantity": 2}], "shipGroups": [{"shippingCost": 5.0, "salesTax": 2.0}], "orderAdjustments": [], "globalAdjustments": []}, "expected_output": {"grand_total": 27.0}, "test_cases": [{"name": "baseline", "payload": {"cartLines": [{"price": 10.0, "quantity": 2}], "shipGroups": [{"shippingCost": 5.0, "salesTax": 2.0}], "orderAdjustments": [], "globalAdjustments": []}, "expected_output": {"grand_total": 27.0}}, {"name": "with_order_discount", "payload": {"cartLines": [{"price": 15.0, "quantity": 1}, {"price": 5.0, "quantity": 3}], "shipGroups": [{"shippingCost": 8.0, "salesTax": 4.0}], "orderAdjustments": [{"amount": -5.0, "description": "Line\u2011item discount"}], "globalAdjustments": []}, "expected_output": {"grand_total": 37.0}}, {"name": "multiple_ship_groups_and_global_adjustment", "payload": {"cartLines": [{"price": 20.0, "quantity": 1}], "shipGroups": [{"shippingCost": 3.0, "salesTax": 1.0}, {"shippingCost": 2.0, "salesTax": 0.5}], "orderAdjustments": [], "globalAdjustments": [{"amount": -2.0, "description": "Coupon code"}]}, "expected_output": {"grand_total": 24.5}}]}